            <ArticleTitle>Intercostal neuralgia following stellate ganglion block. An infrequent complication.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>850-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The case is described of a 78-year-old female patient who experienced temporary but severe chest wall pain following stellate ganglion block. The possible mechanisms and treatment of this complication are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
